00:28:55.620 --> 00:28:58.493
You know I went to a meeting of
similar intent to this in Berlin.

00:28:59.483 --> 00:29:01.775
Attended by the
Chancellor himself,

00:29:02.141 --> 00:29:04.381
and Goering and Himmler.

00:29:06.060 --> 00:29:07.751
It lasted until the sun came up.

00:29:08.635 --> 00:29:12.195
We spoke about the future of
the world in a serious way.

00:29:14.203 --> 00:29:16.189
When the first rays of
light entered the room,

00:29:16.214 --> 00:29:19.267
