they were forced to eat grass.

00:29:38.443 --> 00:29:41.616
And we watched as we
sipped our coffee.

00:29:47.349 --> 00:29:49.796
We should all remember
this is serious business.

00:29:59.396 --> 00:30:00.716
Oh, Diana.

00:30:02.847 --> 00:30:05.527
