00:42:53.083 --> 00:42:54.393
Not yet.

00:42:57.361 --> 00:42:58.620
Not yet.

00:43:01.117 --> 00:43:03.409
I have this work to
do cos now I know

00:43:04.235 --> 00:43:05.588
that I will change.

00:43:07.852 --> 00:43:09.332
That I have to change.

00:43:11.124 --> 00:43:12.447
And change for good...

00:43:13.017 --> 00:43:14.096
Lizzie.

00:43:19.364 --> 00:43:20.644
Not just yet.

