00:45:13.803 --> 00:45:15.083
I saw him leave.

00:45:17.006 --> 00:45:20.286
He keeps this apartment expressly
for this purpose, doesn't he?

00:45:22.443 --> 00:45:24.363
Are you following me, Mr Shelby?

00:45:25.388 --> 00:45:26.876
