00:45:46.260 --> 00:45:47.759
I know things.

00:45:48.683 --> 00:45:50.799
I read people's minds, you know.

00:45:53.723 --> 00:45:57.019
Little glances across
tables. It's a gift.

00:45:57.043 --> 00:45:58.455
The whole family

00:45:59.243 --> 00:46:01.283
witches and sorcerers.

00:46:10.316 --> 00:46:12.056
Your uncle will disown you.

00:46:13.349 --> 00:46:16.111
Fucking his business
partner behind his back.

00:46:17.221 --> 00:46:18.736
You think he has morals?

00:46:18.918 --> 00:46:20.174
He's a Catholic.

00:46:20.205 --> 00:46:22.843
Men do what they want,
women do what they are told.

00:46:24.781 --> 00:46:26.221
Will you tell Michael?

00:46:27.479 --> 00:46:28.799
Michael is family.

00:46:30.443 --> 00:46:31.963
We are a family healed.

00:46:33.765 --> 00:46:35.620
You have no interest in me,

00:46:36.003 --> 00:46:37.243
